{
  "name": "Contacto Portafolio Danny",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📩 FASE 1 — Entrada\nWebhook del **formulario de contacto** del portafolio.\n\n**Body esperado:**\n`{ nombre, email, empresa, telefono, tipo, mensaje }`\n\n**Config:** POST · path `contacto-portafolio` · Response = Respond node.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note-c1",
      "name": "Nota 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, -40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📊📧 FASE 2-4 — Registro y avisos\n1. **Registrar en Sheets:** pestaña `Contactos` (Fecha | Nombre | Email | Empresa | Telefono | Tipo | Mensaje).\n2. **Notificar a Danny:** correo con todos los datos del lead.\n3. **Auto-responder al visitante:** correo \"en breve te contacto\".\n\n⚠️ Reemplaza `REEMPLAZAR_ID_SHEET` y el correo de Danny si cambia.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "note-c2",
      "name": "Nota 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [640, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📱 FASE 5 — WhatsApp (OPCIONAL)\nNodo **desactivado** por defecto. Avisa al visitante por WhatsApp usando la **Meta Cloud API**.\n\nPara activarlo:\n1. Consigue `PHONE_NUMBER_ID` y un token permanente en Meta.\n2. Reemplaza `REEMPLAZAR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID` y `REEMPLAZAR_TOKEN_META`.\n3. Habilita el nodo (click derecho → Enable).\n\n⚠️ El número debe tener plantilla aprobada o estar dentro de la ventana de 24h.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "note-c3",
      "name": "Nota 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1100, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "contacto-portafolio",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c-webhook",
      "name": "Recibir Formulario",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [40, 300],
      "webhookId": "contacto-portafolio"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Normaliza el body del formulario de contacto.\nconst b = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json || {};\nconst nombre = (b.nombre || '').toString().trim();\nconst email = (b.email || '').toString().trim();\nconst empresa = (b.empresa || '').toString().trim() || '—';\nconst telefono = (b.telefono || '').toString().trim() || '—';\nconst tipo = (b.tipo || 'Consulta').toString().trim();\nconst mensaje = (b.mensaje || '').toString().trim();\n\nreturn [{ json: { nombre, email, empresa, telefono, tipo, mensaje } }];"
      },
      "id": "c-normalizar",
      "name": "Normalizar Contacto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [280, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REEMPLAZAR_ID_SHEET",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Contactos",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Fecha": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
            "Nombre": "={{ $json.nombre }}",
            "Email": "={{ $json.email }}",
            "Empresa": "={{ $json.empresa }}",
            "Telefono": "={{ $json.telefono }}",
            "Tipo": "={{ $json.tipo }}",
            "Mensaje": "={{ $json.mensaje }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c-sheets",
      "name": "Registrar en Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [520, 300],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "dannyendara28@gmail.com",
        "subject": "={{ 'Nuevo contacto (' + $('Normalizar Contacto').item.json.tipo + '): ' + $('Normalizar Contacto').item.json.nombre }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "={{ (() => { const j = $('Normalizar Contacto').item.json; const row = (k,v)=>`<tr><td style='padding:6px 14px 6px 0;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top'>${k}</td><td style='padding:6px 0;color:#e2e8f0'>${v||'—'}</td></tr>`; return `<div style='background:#0a0f1a;padding:24px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif'><table width='540' align='center' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' style='max-width:540px;width:100%;background:#0e1626;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)'><tr><td style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#22d3ee,#a855f7);padding:18px 28px'><span style='font-family:monospace;color:#0a0f1a;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px'>&gt;_ Nuevo contacto 🎯</span></td></tr><tr><td style='padding:26px 28px'><p style='margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;color:#cbd5e1'>Te escribieron desde tu portafolio:</p><table cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' style='font-size:14px'>${row('Tipo',j.tipo)}${row('Nombre',j.nombre)}${row('Email',j.email)}${row('Empresa',j.empresa)}${row('Teléfono',j.telefono)}</table><div style='margin-top:18px;padding:14px 16px;background:#0a0f1a;border-left:3px solid #a855f7;border-radius:8px;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:14px'>${j.mensaje}</div><div style='margin-top:22px'><a href='mailto:${j.email}' style='display:inline-block;background:#22d3ee;color:#0a0f1a;text-decoration:none;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold'>Responder a ${j.nombre}</a></div></td></tr><tr><td style='padding:14px 28px;background:#0a0f1a;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:#64748b;font-size:12px;font-family:monospace'>Portafolio · Danny Endara</td></tr></table></div>`; })() }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c-gmail-danny",
      "name": "Notificar a Danny",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [760, 300],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Normalizar Contacto').item.json.email }}",
        "subject": "={{ 'Gracias por escribir, ' + $('Normalizar Contacto').item.json.nombre }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "={{ (() => { const j = $('Normalizar Contacto').item.json; return `<div style='background:#0a0f1a;padding:24px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif'><table width='500' align='center' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' style='max-width:500px;width:100%;background:#0e1626;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)'><tr><td style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#22d3ee,#a855f7);padding:20px 28px'><span style='font-family:monospace;color:#0a0f1a;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px'>&gt;_ Danny Endara</span></td></tr><tr><td style='padding:28px'><h1 style='margin:0 0 12px;font-size:21px;color:#ffffff'>¡Gracias, ${j.nombre}! 🙌</h1><p style='margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#cbd5e1'>Recibí tu mensaje desde mi portafolio y <strong style='color:#22d3ee'>en breve te contacto</strong> por este correo o a tu número (${j.telefono}).</p><p style='margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#cbd5e1'>Si es algo urgente, escríbeme directo:</p><table cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0'><tr><td style='padding-right:10px'><a href='https://wa.me/584224543543' style='display:inline-block;background:#25D366;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold'>WhatsApp</a></td><td><a href='mailto:dannyendara28@gmail.com' style='display:inline-block;background:#22d3ee;color:#0a0f1a;text-decoration:none;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold'>Email</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style='padding:16px 28px;background:#0a0f1a;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:#64748b;font-size:12px'>Danny Endara · AI Automation Engineer · Frontend · Sistemas</td></tr></table></div>`; })() }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c-gmail-visitante",
      "name": "Auto-responder al Visitante",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1000, 300],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://graph.facebook.com/v20.0/REEMPLAZAR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID/messages",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer REEMPLAZAR_TOKEN_META" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ messaging_product: 'whatsapp', to: $('Normalizar Contacto').item.json.telefono, type: 'text', text: { body: 'Hola ' + $('Normalizar Contacto').item.json.nombre + ', recibí tu mensaje en el portafolio de Danny. En breve te contacta. ¡Gracias!' } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c-whatsapp",
      "name": "Avisar por WhatsApp (opcional)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1240, 300],
      "disabled": true,
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"ok\": true, \"message\": \"¡Gracias! Te contacto en breve.\" } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c-respond",
      "name": "Responder al Formulario",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1480, 300]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Recibir Formulario": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Normalizar Contacto", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Normalizar Contacto": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Registrar en Google Sheets", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Registrar en Google Sheets": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Notificar a Danny", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Notificar a Danny": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Auto-responder al Visitante", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Auto-responder al Visitante": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Avisar por WhatsApp (opcional)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Avisar por WhatsApp (opcional)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Responder al Formulario", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
